[King@us30.ecn.purdue.edu writes:]
[] IN the current version of the nethack (NH3.8) you can set
[] option which prevents you of offending youe own pet ...
[] ....  Is there any way to turn off this option
[] during the game ?

The option in question can be accessed during play using the "O"ption
command. after the prompt write:
safepet    - to prevent you from hitting your pet or
nosafepet  - to allow you to hit your pet

a related option is "confirm", concerning peaceful monsters.

